  "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Soft knit T-shirt fabric based on the supplied photos; the blocked vendor page did not expose exact fiber content.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A playful white graphic tee for mom, dad, girls, and boys, made for casual family days, travel photos, and matching weekend outfits.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print reference:</strong> Playful Graphic places cheerful cartoon icons across the shoulder and chest for a bright, kid-friendly matching look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Crew neckline, short sleeves, easy relaxed tee shape, and one white graphic colorway. Shorts, denim, sunglasses, bags, shoes, and other props shown in photos are styling only.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold on gentle, wash inside out with similar colors, line dry or tumble low, and avoid bleach. This care guidance is conservative because direct vendor care text was not available.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> girls and boys 1-2Y through 9-10Y, mothers S-2XL, and fathers S-4XL.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Size Chart</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Age</th>\n<th>Weight (kg)</th>\n<th>Height (cm)</th>\n<th>Chest/Bust (cm)</th>\n<th>Sleeve / Skirt (cm)</th>\n<th>Pant / Short (cm)</th>\n<th>Hip (cm)</th>\n<th>Waist (cm)</th>\n<th>Garment Length (cm)</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Girl 1-2 Years</td>\n<td>1-2</td>\n<td>8.5-11</td>\n<td>75-85</td>\n<td>66</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>66</td>\n<td>36</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Girl 2 Years</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>11-14</td>\n<td>85-95</td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>74</td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>39</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Girl 3 Years</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>14-16.5</td>\n<td>95-105</td>\n<td>74</td>\n<td>18</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>78</td>\n<td>74</td>\n<td>42</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Girl 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>16.5-20</td>\n<td>105-115</td>\n<td>78</td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>