195</td>\n<td>122</td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>122</td>\n<td>110</td>\n<td>75</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Playful Graphic keeps the family match light and easy: a white tee with colorful cartoon details that feels right for park days, vacation snapshots, and relaxed summer plans.</p>\n<p>The attached vendor chart publishes fit guidance by height and weight for children, mothers, and fathers. Because it does not publish garment measurements, chest, sleeve, and length follow the store's existing family tee grading curve while hip and waist are derived by the canonical top rules.</p>\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Four-role family match:</strong> Sizes are prepared for girls, boys, mothers, and fathers.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cheerful graphic look:</strong> Colorful cartoon icons add a playful family-photo detail.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy tee silhouette:</strong> Crew-neck short-sleeve tops pair naturally with denim, shorts, skirts, or casual trousers.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vendor-backed fit range:</strong> Child 80-150, Mother S-2XL, and Father S-4XL rows are transcribed from the attached chart.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Single included garment:</strong> This listing covers the graphic tees only; the infant crawler table and all styled accessories are not included.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Choose each family member's size and build a matching white graphic tee outfit for sunny plans, casual portraits, and everyday memories.</p>",
